OL,3,AExiled critic of Rwandan president
OL,4,Afound beheaded
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Rwandan army sergeant major,
OL,7,Fwho became an outspoken critic of
OL,8,FPresident Paul Kagame, has been found
OL,9,Fbeheaded in neighbouring Uganda.
OL,11,FRobert Kabera, 50, fled Rwanda after
OL,12,Fbeing accused of sexual assault, which
OL,13,Fhe denied. He sought asylum in
OL,14,Fneighbouring Uganda, citing political
OL,15,Fpersecution.
OL,17,FUgandan police spokesperson Kituuma
OL,18,FRusoke on Monday said that Kabera's
OL,19,Fhead had still not been recovered. His
OL,20,Fbody was discovered by local residents
OL,21,Fon the outskirts of Kampala over the
OL,22,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
