OL,3,AExiled critic of Rwandan president
OL,4,Afound beheaded
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Rwandan government has not publicly
OL,7,Fcommented on the killing. Several
OL,8,Fcritics of Kagame have been killed,
OL,9,Fboth in Rwanda and abroad.
